# The thin diagram `MD47`

[mild] figure 4.7 (part): `η` with at least three arrows; the square `x → a → y`, `x → b → y` with arms `c₁ → c₂ → x` (the last two arrows of `η`) and `b → y → a` (`β`, `ω'`).

